{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u",
    "description": "The raw east-face potential-vorticity flux of the SADOURNY75_ENERGY Coriolis scheme on the mom6_cgrid: pvf_u(i,j,k) = 0.25 * ((q(i,j,k)*(vh(i+1,j,k) + vh(i,j,k))) + (q(i,j-1,k)*(vh(i,j-1,k) + vh(i+1,j-1,k)))) * IdxCu(i,j), the CAu argument of MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc before the bound_coriolis clamp and the -KEx addition (the SADOURNY75_ENERGY loop, with q(i,j) the layer potential vorticity at the q-points, vh the north-face layer volume fluxes of the two cells straddling the east face — vh(i+1,j)/vh(i,j) the north faces of the east/west neighbors of the north side, vh(i,j-1)/vh(i+1,j-1) of the south side — and IdxCu(i,j) = 1/dxCu the east-face 1/length). SOLID-WALL BOUNDARIES: the east domain edge (i = N_I) and the south domain edge (j = 1) carry a zero-gradient halo, so the wall regions MIRROR the out-of-bounds neighbor onto the edge cell itself: the i = N_I region reads vh(N_I,j,k) in place of vh(N_I+1,j,k) and the j = 1 region reads q(i,1,k)/vh(i,1,k) in place of q(i,0,k)/vh(i,0,k) (the SE corner mirrors both) — NOT clamped reads of nonexistent cells. The rule is a named-op rule (esm-spec 9.6.8), applied once per consumer equation as mom6_cgrid_pvf_u(q, vh, IdxCu); q and vh must be declared [i,j,k] fields and IdxCu a free [i,j] name resolved in the consuming model (esm-spec 9.6.1 where clause; the free-name contract of grids/mom6_cgrid/grid.esm).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:mom6_cgrid",
      "grid:mom6_cgrid",
      "op:pvf",
      "order:0",
      "bc:wall",
      "axes:i,j,k"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Adcroft, A., et al. (2019). The GFDL global ocean and sea ice model OM4.0. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 11(10), 3167-3211.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2019MS001726"
      },
      {
        "citation": "MOM6 source: MOM_CoriolisAdv.F90 CorAdCalc SADOURNY75_ENERGY CAu at :897-925; the face conventions of the mom6_cgrid grid.esm."
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u": {
      "params": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
      "match": {
        "op": "mom6_cgrid_pvf_u",
        "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"]
      },
      "where": {
        "q": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        },
        "vh": {
          "shape": ["i", "j", "k"]
        }
      },
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [2, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [2, "N_J"],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
            [1, 1],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ],
          [
            ["N_I", "N_I"],
            [1, 1],
            [1, "N_K"]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": [1, { "op": "-", "args": ["N_I", 1] }],
              "j": [2, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, "j", "k"]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": ["q", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", "i", { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", { "op": "+", "args": ["i", 1] }, { "op": "-", "args": ["j", 1] }, "k"]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "op": "index",
                      "args": ["IdxCu", "i", "j"]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i", "j", "k"],
            "args": ["q", "vh", "IdxCu"],
            "ranges": {
              "i": ["N_I", "N_I"],
              "j": [2, "N_J"],
              "k": [1, "N_K"]
            },
            "expr": {
              "op": "*",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "const",
                  "args": [],
                  "value": 0.25,
                  "units": "1"
                },
                {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        {
                          "op": "*",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "index",
                              "args": ["q", "i", "j", "k"]
                            },
                            {
                              "op": "+",
                              "args": [
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"]
                                },
                                {
                                  "op": "index",
                                  "args": ["vh", "i", "j", "k"]
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "op": "*",
